- U | volunteer in a member's office, research and drafting a few evenings a week | habit | v: achievement, self-direction | title: campaign volunteer | aims: political adviser | tribal: offer to sit behind the band's speaker, and help shape what he says | magic: offer your pen to a councillor's secretary, a few evenings a week | chance: 35
- B | look up your old school rival, now a councillor, and ask what it takes | v: power, achievement | aims: council candidate | tribal: seek out your rival from childhood, now a voice at the fire, and ask how it is done | magic: call on your old academy rival, now on the council, and ask what it takes | chance: 80
- R | join an evening debating club, and argue every week for the joy of it | habit | v: stimulation, hedonism | grants: debating | self_control: + | tribal: join the old talkers who argue at the fire every night, for the joy of it | magic: join a disputation society in the lower town, and argue every week | chance: 80
- G | let it rest: that debate belongs to the person you were back then | v: tradition | tribal: let it rest: that was a child's moment at the fire | magic: let it rest: the academy's hall belongs to the student you were | chance: 80
